        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The author opens the &quot;Publish&quot; step in the Studio, the &quot;Offline download price&quot; box, enters a price and presses &quot;Save price&quot;. E1." vertex="1">
