        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system (Tour) only stores the price: the tour status does not change and the tour is not sent for review again; it returns the price, the number of sales and the revenue." vertex="1">
