        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The system replaces the download section with a &quot;Buy the tour to download&quot; box (price, &quot;Listening online stays free&quot;) and checks whether the Tourist has already bought it. A1, A2, A3." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="320" x="-160" y="610" as="geometry" />
