        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="9. MoMo sends an IPN to Tour; the system checks the signature and the amount, then sets the order to &quot;Paid&quot;. E5." vertex="1">
